Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=1}========================CHAPTERS AND OPENINGS=====================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:06.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But they were blocked\Nby the Priest Shura,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.17,0:02:08.64,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NAs the four members\Nof Luffy's exploration team
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.72,0:02:11.05,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,know precisely the location\Nof the gold this island
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.14,0:02:15.06,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,has kept secret for 400 years,\Nthey set their sights on it
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.14,0:02:18.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and head south from\Nthe sacrificial altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.90,0:02:20.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,South. I mean.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.94,0:02:25.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Straight, uh, directly\Nsouth, or down.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.94,0:02:29.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Opposite of north.\NOr, uh... Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.07,0:02:32.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FUZA caws]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.07,0:02:34.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but against a real guy? Hm.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.77,0:02:36.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the island is\Nhaving it's fair share of drama.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.90,0:02:40.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I bet these homes were\Nbuilt so far out from the city
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.57,0:02:43.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the hopes of greater\Nlongevity with crops.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.61,0:02:45.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it looks like all this\Nbrush swallowed up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:46.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the mortar and brick.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.07,0:02:47.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope the city's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DIVINE WARRIOR D bleats]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.74,0:02:56.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DIVINE WARRIOR D]\NWhat are you doing here, woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:58.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should be aware\Nthat this is the path
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.08,0:03:02.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to God's Shrine! Proceeding any\Nfurther would be insolent!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:04.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[bleats]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.17,0:03:06.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NWould you get down?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.43,0:03:07.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you even have a clue as
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.83,0:03:10.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the archaeological\Nsignificance of these ruins?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.38,0:03:11.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're priceless.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.72,0:03:14.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growls]\NHow dare you talk back!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.14,0:03:15.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NWhat are you doing here anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have some kind\Nof business with me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.46,0:03:20.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DIVINE WARRIOR D]\NHmph!\NYes, simple business, actually.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.84,0:03:23.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been charged by God\Nto eliminate any Shandorians
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.47,0:03:26.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or Blue Sea people\NI find with my Axe Dial!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.86,0:03:31.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Heh. Seis Fleurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:34.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:37.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And with a twist.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.14,0:03:43.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Such a lack of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:52.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.04,0:04:57.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN D]\NAnd you call yourself divine?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.33,0:05:02.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These guys are gonna\Nbe the end of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.50,0:05:05.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So far, they've managed\Nto kill a lot more of us
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.50,0:05:06.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than we have of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.55,0:05:07.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NSouth should be to the right,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.84,0:05:09.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so if I keep to the right,\NI should find it.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.84,0:05:11.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's one of\Nthose Blue Sea People
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.52,0:05:13.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper was talking about.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.10,0:05:14.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Better go take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:18.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:20.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NA guerilla!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.81,0:05:22.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And he looks pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:24.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]\NDie!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.75,0:05:26.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.42,0:05:34.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fellas have some serious\Nanger management issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:36.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DIVINE WARRIOR F\Nbleats, whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:41.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DIVINE WARRIOR F]\NP-Please, no! I surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.26,0:05:46.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I give up! I lose, you win.\NJust, please, don't kill me!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.13,0:05:46.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-I want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.85,0:05:48.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(797,1053)}– [gunshot]\N– [screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.52,0:05:52.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NNot again.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.82,0:05:54.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, nutcase.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.29,0:05:57.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're not a Priest, then go\Nfind another goat to shoot!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.57,0:05:59.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:00.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.91,0:06:27.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right. What's the deal\Nwith these glowing pistols?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.22,0:06:31.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NWhere'd he go?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.10,0:06:32.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Couldn't have gotten far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.31,0:06:35.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.81,0:06:36.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.89,0:06:38.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.95,0:06:52.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You put up a good fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.78,0:06:55.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm almost sorry I\Nunderestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:05.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks, pal.\NBut I should apologize to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.51,0:07:07.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I took you for a loser.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.51,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHe never moved his feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.37,0:07:32.13,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]\NPagaya said\Nthere were different types
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.21,0:07:34.38,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,of Dials up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:38.43,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this guy has one\Nor two stuck to his shoes.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.51,0:07:40.76,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause when he moves,\Ngusts of wind shoot
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.84,0:07:42.18,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,from his feet.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.60,0:07:45.31,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWhat else could it be?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.39,0:07:47.60,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And those pistols of his\Nflash as bright as the sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:50.44,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,blinding me every time he fires.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.49,0:07:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:55.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:07:58.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}[ZORO]\NTiger...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.45,0:07:59.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's using all three?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:01.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ZORO]\N...Trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.54,0:08:05.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.71,0:08:07.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a hot shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:08.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:17.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.68,0:08:24.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah. This Blue Sea idiot\Nhas no clue about using Dials.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.48,0:08:26.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM]\NHe doesn't even stand a chance.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM]\NHey! Guess what this is!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.10,0:08:33.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.13,0:08:35.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[BRAHAM]\NIt's called a Milky Dial!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.43,0:08:37.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO whimpers]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.39,0:08:42.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, aerial combat\Nisn't just leaping around
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.89,0:08:44.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,out of desperation.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.65,0:08:48.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That looks big.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.99,0:09:01.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NA ton of wood,\Nand these things would make
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.51,0:09:03.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for a killer barbeque.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.39,0:09:11.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:24.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO pants]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:28.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was stupid.\NWh-What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.73,0:09:30.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThis guy's\Nalready faster than me,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.81,0:09:33.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I hang myself\Nout like an easy target.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.00,0:09:36.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh. And I got\Na bullet in my leg.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.42,0:09:38.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Agh. Genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:41.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gotta be something I can do\Nabout those flashing pistols.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:43.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:46.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those guns of yours\Nare pretty nice accessories.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.44,0:09:51.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But too bad for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.33,0:09:53.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I found my lucky goggles.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.86,0:09:55.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which means\Nyour little blinding trick...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.99,0:09:58.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...won't work on me anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.01,0:10:01.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You might as well give up.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.20,0:10:04.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM]\NThose just\Nlook like regular goggles.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.12,0:10:06.00,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO gasps]\NHe found me out!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.08,0:10:09.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not a big fan of\Nmy flash guns are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.65,0:10:12.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Being a swordsman, you\Nneed close quarters to fight,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.23,0:10:14.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which I won't give you.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.11,0:10:16.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't understand your\Nreasons for being here
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.15,0:10:17.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I don't care.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.57,0:10:19.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I will say that your mere\Npresence defines you as
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.61,0:10:22.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,an enemy of the Shandorians.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.24,0:10:24.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I'm telling you,\Nsurrender or die.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.95,0:10:27.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which might happen sooner\Nif we keep standing here.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.62,0:10:30.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That leg of yours\Nisn't getting any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:34.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doesn't hurt too bad.\NBarely made a dent.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.75,0:10:36.63,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NGetting shot while\NI made smug comments about
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.71,0:10:40.30,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,some big dead eel proves\NI'm lacking in concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right.\NGuess I found the perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.18,0:10:47.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,situation to test\Nthat technique again.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.82,0:10:49.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NLet's give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:50.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:01.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.04,0:11:03.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.10,0:11:11.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM]\NHmph!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.44,0:11:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think you can run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.01,0:11:15.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NSight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.06,0:11:17.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sound. Smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.99,0:11:20.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Taste. Touch. And thought.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.66,0:11:24.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These six roots ground us all by\Nway of good, evil, and peace.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.12,0:11:30.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NAnd of course, each can\Neither be pure or impure.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.66,0:11:33.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These are the\N36 earthly desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:36.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM]\NHmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.29,0:11:38.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen up, I have\Nthe barrel of a cannon
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.37,0:11:40.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,aimed directly at your head.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.50,0:11:43.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And all you have\Nare a couple of pistols.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.39,0:11:46.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In both distance and power,\Nmy weapon's superior.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.02,0:11:48.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've done very well.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.05,0:11:51.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you're still gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.55,0:11:52.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM]\NHmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:58.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM]\NWhat cannon?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.56,0:11:59.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're outta your mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.99,0:12:03.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All I see are three swords.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.41,0:12:07.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen\Na Flying Blade Attack?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.33,0:12:08.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM]\NAttack this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:09.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.58,0:12:13.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ZORO]\NSingle sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:15.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.68,0:12:22.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ZORO]\NThirty-six caliber phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.07,0:12:28.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.99,0:12:33.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.95,0:12:42.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThat looked uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.37,0:12:45.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing personal,\Nbeing natural enemies and, all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.42,0:12:48.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you're in the dirt 'cause\NI hate being told what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:49.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No other reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:56.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll survive. You watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:02.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whistling]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:03.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.11,0:13:08.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN Y yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:17.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[distant gunfire, explosions
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:19.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NHmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:22.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.89,0:13:25.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWhere am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:27.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NHm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:28.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI've lost\Nall sense of direction.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.32,0:13:31.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The trees are too tall\Nfor me to see the sun.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.16,0:13:32.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.62,0:13:35.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Robin!\NPlease find me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.50,0:13:37.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna be left on this\Nstinking island just to die
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.91,0:13:40.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and turn into food\Nfor gigantic bugs.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.17,0:13:43.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if I do die, will there even\Nbe a doctor waiting for me?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.25,0:13:44.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.80,0:13:46.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When you're dead, you're dead,\Nand no doctor can save you.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.83,0:13:48.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.33,0:13:50.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I'm stuck in this awful\Nplace, thinking about death
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.39,0:13:53.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and doctors, and wondering: Why\Ncouldn't I be something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.31,0:13:55.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like a dentist.\NDentist would be nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.20,0:13:57.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Poke peoples teeth.\NMake them feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:14:00.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No giant sky sharks and\Nwinged people trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.93,0:14:02.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At least I got my stick.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.68,0:14:05.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. Maybe I've already died\Nand gone to Heaven.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.85,0:14:08.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NThese look like ruins.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.10,0:14:09.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were supposed\Nto meet at ruins!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.92,0:14:12.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]\NMaybe they're\Nalready here waiting for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.89,0:14:14.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I was\Nso fast I beat them!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.82,0:14:17.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so impressed with\Nmy shrewd navigational skills,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.49,0:14:18.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they led me to just\Nthe right place.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.07,0:14:20.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:23.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]\NI'm right!\NI'm the first one here!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.28,0:14:25.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:27.62,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NA raccoon-dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:29.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.37,0:14:32.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gum Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.92,0:14:35.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...Balloon!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.04,0:14:41.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI can do this\Nall day if you want,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.88,0:14:43.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but you can't win.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.21,0:14:45.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rifles and cannons won't\Nleave a scratch on me.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.01,0:14:47.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rubber body and all.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.17,0:14:49.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NSo it would seem.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.22,0:14:51.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time for a change of tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.30,0:14:54.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.66,0:15:03.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gross! What is that smell?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.91,0:15:05.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NThis weapon\Nis called the burn bazooka.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.96,0:15:08.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,By igniting the gas released\Nfrom the breath dial,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.42,0:15:10.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a deadly blue flame is created.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.46,0:15:13.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which will incinerate anything\Nin it's path instantly.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.72,0:15:17.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can\Nbounce this back at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.06,0:15:28.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:34.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat the heck is that thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.73,0:15:37.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It burned right\Nthrough that giant tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.82,0:15:41.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhere'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:51.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:52.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:02.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.72,0:16:03.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(2563,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)\fad(150,0)}Gum-gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.97,0:16:05.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Stamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:28.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:31.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:33.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Spear!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.39,0:16:53.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSo you like bazookas, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.60,0:16:55.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get a load of this!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.77,0:16:57.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.79,0:16:59.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:02.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[WYPER]\NBurn...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:08.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY, WYPER]\N– ...Bazooka!\N– ...Bazooka!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.24,0:17:12.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.29,0:17:15.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.53,0:17:28.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NStraw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.91,0:17:36.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThat bastard's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:46.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:48.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:50.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:54.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:56.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NSanji?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.37,0:17:58.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, Sanji! Get up, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.24,0:18:02.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIERRE whimpers, screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.04,0:18:04.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is bad! This is really bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.91,0:18:06.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:10.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.57,0:18:15.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I... I can't even\Nhear his heart beating.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.28,0:18:16.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:18.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:22.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.02,0:18:25.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a foolishly angry man.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.36,0:18:27.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I'd come here today\Nand brought with me pain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:31.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and destruction, it would have\Nbeen the first thing you felt.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.57,0:18:34.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NThen why are you here, Eneru?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.27,0:18:40.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]\NI expected a warmer hello.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.58,0:18:46.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It has been six years\Nnow, my former God...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.54,0:18:47.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...Gan Fall.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
